-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ז/6 (9.7.2017): קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשע"ז;
-- קצובת ביגוד לעובדי הוראה בחינוך הגופני; קצובת ביגוד לעובדי הוראה בחינוך הטכנולוגי
-- The clothing allowance for school year 2016-17 (level 4, pro rata to the
-- position, the caps on employment volume), the additional allowance for
-- physical-education teachers by employment band, and the additional
-- allowance in technological education by profession.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ז/6 — קצובת ביגוד תשע"ז`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, the ministry's address, the date (9.7.2017), the reference number, the addressee and the three-item subject line; no rule.

DECLARE `clothing action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the clothing allowance` HAS `clothing amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the additional clothing allowances` HAS `additional amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `work beyond the employment cap`
    `employ beyond the employment cap`

§§ `1 קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשע"ז`

-- akn:art_1/p1 The heading "תחולה" (application); no rule.
-- akn:art_1/p3 "By the Treasury's instructions on the clothing allowance, act as follows": an introduction to the paragraphs below.
-- akn:art_1/p4 The heading "כללי" (general); no rule.

@desc A teaching employee's school year 2016-17 at one employer, as far as the clothing allowance asks about it.
DECLARE `clothing case` HAS
    `graded as a teaching employee`        IS A BOOLEAN @desc graded on the teaching employees' grading scale
    `employed by a supervised owner`       IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed by an owner of education supervised by the Ministry of Education
    `position with this employer`          IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held with this employer (1 = 100%)
    `position with all the employers`      IS A NUMBER  @desc the total position held with all employers together

-- §1, application: every employee graded as a teaching employee and
-- employed by an owner the ministry supervises.
@ref akn:art_1/p2
GIVEN c IS A `clothing case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teaching employee under this circular` c IF
    c's `graded as a teaching employee` AND c's `employed by a supervised owner`

-- §1א: paid in full with July 2017's salary (school month 11).
@ref akn:art_1__para_a
GIVEN c IS A `clothing case`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `paying the clothing allowance in full with July 2017's salary` c IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the clothing allowance` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `clothing allowance` c
    WITHIN `month number` July
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2016-17/6 section 1a: the clothing allowance is paid in full with July 2017's salary"

-- §1ב: entitled to the clothing allowance as public-facing staff in the
-- civil service, for school year 2016-17 (09/16–08/17).
@ref akn:art_1__para_b
GIVEN c IS A `clothing case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the clothing allowance for school year 2016-17` c IF
    `a teaching employee under this circular` c

-- §1ג: at level 4, that is 2,108 NIS.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c
`the level-4 clothing allowance` MEANS 2108

-- §1ד: the allowance is paid pro rata to the position, at most one full
-- position.
@ref akn:art_1__para_d
@export default The clothing allowance a teaching employee is owed by one employer for school year 2016-17 under owners' circular 2016-17/6
GIVEN c IS A `clothing case` @desc the employee's year at this employer
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `clothing allowance` c IS
    IF `entitled to the clothing allowance for school year 2016-17` c
    THEN `the level-4 clothing allowance` TIMES `clothing position share` c
    ELSE 0

GIVEN c IS A `clothing case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `clothing position share` c IS
    min (c's `position with this employer`) 1

-- §1ה: employed by more than one employer and above 100% in total: entitled
-- at each employer separately to the share for the position held with it
-- (`clothing position share`) — the reading adopted for
-- F-2016-17_tashaz_06-a, where §1ד's cap and §1ה part.
@ref akn:art_1__para_e
GIVEN c IS A `clothing case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled at each employer separately to the share for the position there` c IF
        c's `position with all the employers` GREATER THAN c's `position with this employer`
    AND c's `position with all the employers` GREATER THAN 1

-- F-2016-17_tashaz_06-a: 70% at one employer and 60% at another: §1ה pays
-- 1.3 allowances in all, §1ד's cap allows one.
`the clothing shares §1ה pays at two employers` MEANS 0.7 PLUS 0.6
`§1ד and §1ה give a two-employer teacher different totals` MEANS
    NOT (`the clothing shares §1ה pays at two employers` EQUALS min (`the clothing shares §1ה pays at two employers`) 1)
#ASSERT `§1ד and §1ה give a two-employer teacher different totals`

§§ `1ו The caps on employment volume`

DECLARE `employment track` IS ONE OF
    `teacher outside the reforms`
    `principal outside the reforms`
    `teacher under Oz LaTmura in full implementation`
    `teacher under Ofek Hadash`

-- §1ו: 140% for every teaching employee, 150% for a principal outside the
-- reforms; ¶2: 125% under Oz LaTmura in full implementation and 117% under
-- Ofek Hadash; all with all employers together.
@ref akn:art_1__para_f akn:art_1__para_f/p2
GIVEN t IS AN `employment track`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the employment cap` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `teacher outside the reforms` THEN 1.4
    WHEN `principal outside the reforms` THEN 1.5
    WHEN `teacher under Oz LaTmura in full implementation` THEN 1.25
    WHEN `teacher under Ofek Hadash` THEN 1.17

-- The restriction itself, on the teacher (¶1) and on the employment (¶2),
-- with all employers together and no time limit; the exception is ¶3's,
-- an approval under the exceptional-employment procedure.
GIVEN `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `the teaching employee does not work beyond the cap unless approved` `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS
    IF `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the teaching employee`
         SHANT `work beyond the employment cap`
         LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "circular 2016-17/6 section 1f: the teaching employee is restricted from working beyond the cap with all employers"

GIVEN `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `the employer does not employ beyond the cap unless approved` `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS
    IF `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the employer`
         SHANT `employ beyond the employment cap`
         LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2016-17/6 section 1f: employment beyond the cap is restricted"

-- §1ו ¶3 and §1 ¶5: subject to the 2016-17 exceptional-employment
-- procedure (named, not reproduced: an input); the circular neither changes
-- the conditions for approval nor permits employment beyond the caps.
@ref akn:art_1__para_f/p3 akn:art_1/p5
GIVEN t IS AN `employment track`
      `total position` IS A NUMBER @desc the position with all employers together (1 = 100%)
      `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS A BOOLEAN @desc approved under the 2016-17 exceptional-employment procedure, which this circular names and does not reproduce
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employment within the cap` t `total position` `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IF
    `total position` AT MOST `the employment cap` t
    OR `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure`

#ASSERT `employment within the cap` `teacher under Oz LaTmura in full implementation` 1.25 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`employment within the cap` `teacher outside the reforms` 1.45 FALSE)

§§ `2 קצובת ביגוד נוספת למורה לחינוך גופני`

-- §2 ¶1: in addition to the general allowance, and covering the purchase
-- of sun-protection products.
@ref akn:art_2/p1
`the physical-education allowance is in addition to the general one` MEANS TRUE
`the physical-education allowance covers sun-protection products` MEANS TRUE

-- §2's table as printed: the amounts of circular 2011-12/8 updated, as at
-- 1/9/16, by the employment rate. 999 stands for "ומעלה" (and above).
@ref akn:art_2/p2 akn:art_2/t1
DECLARE `physical-education band` HAS
    `band from rate`   IS A NUMBER
    `band to rate`     IS A NUMBER
    `band pe amount`   IS A NUMBER

`the physical-education table` MEANS
    LIST `physical-education band` 0   0.3 0,
         `physical-education band` 0.3 0.5 673,
         `physical-education band` 0.5 999 1342

GIVEN r IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts the table gives for rate` r IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `band pe amount`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD r AT LEAST b's `band from rate` AND r AT MOST b's `band to rate`)
                `the physical-education table`)

-- F-2016-17_tashaz_06-b: "עד 0.3" and "מ-0.3", "עד 0.5" and "מ-0.5" — the
-- bounds 0.3 and 0.5 are each in two rows.
`the table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each` MEANS
        `the amounts the table gives for rate` 0.3 EQUALS LIST 0, 673
    AND `the amounts the table gives for rate` 0.5 EQUALS LIST 673, 1342
#ASSERT `the table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each`

-- The reading adopted: the row that opens at a bound governs it.
@desc The physical-education teacher's employment rate is the table's "שיעור העסקה" (1 = a full position).
GIVEN `employment rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `physical-education allowance` `employment rate` IS
    BRANCH IF `employment rate` AT LEAST 0.5 THEN 1342
           IF `employment rate` AT LEAST 0.3 THEN 673
           OTHERWISE 0

#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD `the amounts the table gives for rate` r EQUALS LIST (`physical-education allowance` r))
            (LIST 0, 0.1, 0.29, 0.31, 0.49, 0.51, 1, 1.4)

§§ `3 קצובת ביגוד בחינוך הטכנולוגי`

-- §3.1א's list, in its printed numbering (1-13).
@ref akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_a/t1
`the professions with shoes and two coats` MEANS
    LIST "מערכות תעופה", "מכטרוניקה", "טרמודינמיקה טכנית ימית", "מערכות סיב\"מ ותיב\"מ",
         "תחזוקת מערכות מכניות", "מערכות מכונאות רכב", "מערכות ממוחשבות ברכב",
         "מערכות הספק, פיקוד ובקרה", "מערכות בקרת אקלים", "אומנות הבישול והאפיה המלונאית",
         "ימאות – ספינות", "מערכות טלוויזיה וקולנוע", "מערכות צילום"

-- §3.1ב's list, in its printed numbering (1-13).
@ref akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_b/t1
`the professions with two coats` MEANS
    LIST "מערכות אלקטרוניות", "מערכות מחשוב ובקרה", "מערכות מחשבים", "תכנון ותכנות מערכות",
         "מערכות ביוטכנולוגיה", "ניהול תיירותי", "ניהול מלונאי", "חינוך לגיל הרך", "עיצוב",
         "אופנה ותלבושות", "עיצוב שיער, וטיפוח החן", "סיעוד", "אומנות שימושית"

#ASSERT count `the professions with shoes and two coats` EQUALS 13
#ASSERT count `the professions with two coats` EQUALS 13
-- No profession is on both lists.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD NOT elem p `the professions with two coats`) `the professions with shoes and two coats`

-- §3.1א ¶2 and §3.1ב ¶2: the value of a pair of shoes and two coats, and of two coats.
@ref akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_a/p2
`the value of shoes and two coats` MEANS 554
@ref akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_b/p2
`the value of two coats` MEANS 344

-- §3 ¶1, §3.1א–ב: a teaching employee in technological education or a
-- vocational instructor in a listed profession gets the items each year.
@ref akn:art_3/p1 akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_a akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_b
GIVEN `profession` IS A STRING @desc the profession taught, as the lists print it
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the full-position technological allowance` `profession` IS
    IF elem `profession` `the professions with shoes and two coats`
    THEN `the value of shoes and two coats`
    ELSE IF elem `profession` `the professions with two coats`
         THEN `the value of two coats`
         ELSE 0

-- §3.2: in addition to the general allowance.
@ref akn:art_3__para_2
`the technological allowance is in addition to the general one` MEANS TRUE

-- §3.3: pro rata to the position, at most one full position.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3
GIVEN `profession` IS A STRING, `position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `technological clothing allowance` `profession` `position` IS
    `the full-position technological allowance` `profession` TIMES min `position` 1

§§ `The month the additional allowances are paid`

-- F-2016-17_tashaz_06-c: §1א dates the general allowance (July 2017's
-- salary); §2 and §3 name no month for theirs. The reading adopted pays
-- them with the general allowance, as allowances "in addition" to it.
`the month §1א names` MEANS `month number` July
GIVEN `profession` IS A STRING, `position` IS A NUMBER, `employment rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `paying the additional allowances with the general one` `profession` `position` `employment rate` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the additional clothing allowances` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST (`technological clothing allowance` `profession` `position`
                                      PLUS `physical-education allowance` `employment rate`)
    WITHIN `the month §1א names`
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2016-17/6 sections 2-3, read with section 1a: the additional allowances are paid with the general one"

DECLARE `section of the circular` IS ONE OF `section 1`, `section 2`, `section 3`
GIVEN s IS A `section of the circular`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `names a payment month` s IF
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `section 1` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

`sections 2 and 3 name no payment month` MEANS
    (NOT `names a payment month` `section 2`) AND NOT `names a payment month` `section 3`
#ASSERT `sections 2 and 3 name no payment month`

-- akn:conclusions The contact line, the signatures (Sonia Peretz, head of the senior division for teaching staff) and the list of copies; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

`a full-position teacher at one employer` MEANS
    `clothing case` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`   IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owner`  IS TRUE
        `position with this employer`     IS 1
        `position with all the employers` IS 1

`a half-position teacher` MEANS
    `clothing case` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`   IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owner`  IS TRUE
        `position with this employer`     IS 0.5
        `position with all the employers` IS 0.5

#ASSERT `clothing allowance` `a full-position teacher at one employer` EQUALS 2108
#ASSERT `clothing allowance` `a half-position teacher` EQUALS 1054
#ASSERT `technological clothing allowance` "מכטרוניקה" 0.5 EQUALS 277
#ASSERT `technological clothing allowance` "סיעוד" 1.2 EQUALS 344
#ASSERT `technological clothing allowance` "מתמטיקה" 1 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `physical-education allowance` 0.4 EQUALS 673

#TRACE `paying the clothing allowance in full with July 2017's salary` `a full-position teacher at one employer` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the clothing allowance` 2108 AT 11
#TRACE `paying the clothing allowance in full with July 2017's salary` `a full-position teacher at one employer` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the clothing allowance` 1000 AT 11
#TRACE `paying the additional allowances with the general one` "מכטרוניקה" 1 0.6 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the additional clothing allowances` 1896 AT 11
